/-! # ExpandA, pc `3612 … 5394`: the mixed groups 10 … 13 (ML-DSA-87, v4)

Four groups with rows 4 … 6 of columns 3 … 6 in slots 0 … 2 and the `tr` rider
in slot 3 (blocks `0 … 19` of the padded public key; kept by `ginit` in groups
11 … 13), each followed by `gfix 7` and `AND`. Group 10 calls `pass3f10`
(`ACC + 0x2000`), groups 11 … 13 copy `ABUF` to `CW`, `HP`, `HP + 0x2000`.
Group 13 absorbs the short last block (`trabs` with one lane group, then the two
padding xors) and extracts `tr` into `TRL`. The groups are in
`Exp/G1013/Grp1{0,1,2,3}.lean` (generated by `Exp/G1013/gen.py` from
`listing.tsv`; glue costs are the static opcode sums). -/

